                <note rend="inline" type="source">813.00/1057: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Salvador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jay</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-02-23T17:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 23,
                                1921—5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received February 24—12:53
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>9. Pact of the Union of the four Central American States was ratified today by
                    the National Congress.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jay</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
